निर्—दट or निर्—दड, mfn. (Prākṛ. for दृत fr. √ दृ cf. आ-दृ?) unkind, malicious, censorious, slanderous;
 useless, unnecessary;
 mad, intoxicated, L.

निर्—दट or निर्—दड, mfn. (Prākṛ. for दृत fr. √ दृ cf. आ-दृ?) unkind, malicious, censorious, slanderous;
 useless, unnecessary;
 mad, intoxicated, L.

निर्-√ वच् (aor. -अवोचत्, AV.; ŚBr.; but mostly used in Pass. -उच्यते, -उच्यमान; cf. निर्-उक्त),
to speak out, express clearly or distinctly, declare, interpret, explain, Br.; Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to derive from (abl.), Hariv.;
to order off, warn off, drive away, tell any one to go away from (abl.), AV.

नि-√ रम् Ā. -रमते (aor. 3. pl. -अरंसत), to rest, come to rest, cease, AV. :
Caus. -रामयति (aor. -अरीरमत्), to cause to rest, stop, detain, RV.;
 (-रमयति) to gladden, give pleasure (by sexual union), BhP.

निर्-√ 2. अस् P. Ā. -अस्यति, ˚ते, (inf. असितुम्, MBh.; aor. -आस्थत्, Bhaṭṭ.). to cast out, throw or drive away, expel, remove, banish from (abl.), ŚBr.; ŚrS.; Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to ward off, keep away, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to strip off (also Ā.), Pāṇ. i, 3, 29,

, Pat.;
to stretch out (हस्तौ, also Ā.), Vop.;
to reject, refuse, decline (as a suitor, an offer, &c.), Sāh.;
to destroy, annihilate, Yājñ.; MBh.; Hit.

नि-√ री P. Ā. -रिणाति, ˚णीते, to dissolve, scatter, tear, rend, destroy, RV.; AV.;
to unveil, discover (Ā.), RV. i, 124, 7; v, 80, 6;
to rush forth, escape (Ā.), ix, 14, 4.

नि-√ रुध् P. Ā. -रुणद्धि, -रुन्द्धे, to hold back, stop, hinder, shut up, confine, restrain, check, suppress, destroy, RV. &c. &c.;
to keep away, ward off, remove, RV.; Br. ;
to surround or invest (a place), Rājat.; BhP.;
to close (lit. ‘a door’ or fig. ‘heart, mind’ &c.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to catch or overtake, Mṛcch. i, 20 :
Caus. -रोधयति, to shut or cause to be shut, Rājat.

नि-√ रूप् P. -रूपयति, to perform, represent on the stage, act, gesticulate, indicate or exhibit by gestures (e.g. रथ-वेगम्, the swiftness of a carriage; वृक्ष-सेचनम्, the watering of a tree, Śak.);
to perceive, notice, find out, ascertain, Hariv.; Kāv. &c.;
to investigate, examine, search, try, consider, reflect upon, Kāv.; Suśr.; Sarvad. &c.;
to state, define, Pañc.; Pur.; Śaṃk.;
to select, choose, appoint as (double acc.), appoint to (loc., dat. or inf.), Kāv.; Pañc. &c.

निर्-√ गम् P. -गच्छति (Subj. -गमाणि pf. p. -जगन्वान्, RV.; ind.p. -गत्य, MBh. &c., -गम्य, MārkP.),
to go out, come forth (often with बहिस्), depart from (abl.), set out, start, RV. &c. &c.;
to come out or appear (as a bud), Śak.;
to go away, disappear, Rājat.; Pañc.;
to enter into any state, undergo (acc.), MBh.;
 (with निद्राम्) to fall asleep, Kathās. :
Caus. -गमयति, to cause or order to set out, BhP. :
Desid. -जिगमिषते, to wish to set out, ib.

P. -णेनेक्ति (Subj. -णेनिजति; Ā. णेनिक्ते, Br.; dat. inf. -णि॑जे, RV.), (P.)
to wash off, cleanse, Br.; ChUp.;
 (Ā.) id., TS.;
to wash or dress or adorn one's self, RV.; &c.

निर्-√ दिश् P. -दिशति (aor. -अदिक्षत्, Daś.; Bhaṭṭ. ind.p. -दिश्य, Śak.; Mālav.; inf. -देष्टुम्, MBh.),
to point to (acc.), show, Mṛcch.; Śak. &c.;
to assign anything to, destine for (dat. or gen.), Hariv.; R. &c.;
to indicate, state, name, define, specify, Br.; Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to take for, regard as (with double acc.), Mn.; Vet.;
to announce, proclaim, foretell, prophesy, MBh.; Var.;
to recommend, advise, suggest (with double acc.), Hit. :
Desid. -दिदिक्षति, to wish to point out or define more closely, Śaṃk.

निर्-√ दॄ (only pf. -ददार), to tear or rend asunder, BhP. :
Caus. -दारयति id., Hariv.;
to cause to be dug up, Rājat.

निर्-√ भिद् P. Ā. -भिनत्ति (2. sg. Subj. aor. -भेद्, RV. i, 104, 8; pf. -बिभेद, MBh. &c.; -बिभिदे, Hariv.; ind.p. -भिद्य, ŚBr.; MBh. &c.),
to cleave or split asunder, divide, open, pierce, hurt, wound, destroy, RV. &c. &c.;
 (with लोचने) to put out, MBh.;
 (with खम्) to form an aperture, excavate, BhP.;
 (with ग्रन्थिम्) to loose, untie, ib.;
to penetrate i.e. find out, investigate, discover, MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Pass. -भिद्यते, to be broken asunder cleave or split open (intrans.), Up.; Suśr.; BhP.

निर्-√ मथ् or मन्थ् P. Ā. -मन्थति, ˚ते, RV.;
 -मथति, ˚ते, MBh.;
 -मथ्नाति, Kāṭh. (fut. -मथिष्यति ind.p. -मथ्य, MBh.; Kāv. &c.);
to grind (fire) out of (wood), to produce (fire) by rubbing (wood together), rub or churn anything out of anything (double acc.), RV.; ŚBr. &c.;
to stir or churn (the sea), MBh.; R.;
to tear or draw or shake out of, extract, MBh.; Kāv.; Pur.;
to shake, agitate (the mind), MBh.;
to grind down, crush, destroy, MBh.; Hariv. &c.:
Pass. -मथ्यते (p. ˚यमान), to be rubbed or churned &c., MBh.; Hariv.

निर्-√ मथ् or मन्थ् P. Ā. -मन्थति, ˚ते, RV.;
 -मथति, ˚ते, MBh.;
 -मथ्नाति, Kāṭh. (fut. -मथिष्यति ind.p. -मथ्य, MBh.; Kāv. &c.);
to grind (fire) out of (wood), to produce (fire) by rubbing (wood together), rub or churn anything out of anything (double acc.), RV.; ŚBr. &c.;
to stir or churn (the sea), MBh.; R.;
to tear or draw or shake out of, extract, MBh.; Kāv.; Pur.;
to shake, agitate (the mind), MBh.;
to grind down, crush, destroy, MBh.; Hariv. &c.:
Pass. -मथ्यते (p. ˚यमान), to be rubbed or churned &c., MBh.; Hariv.

निर्-√ मा Ā. -मिमीते, TS. : AV.; Br.;
 -माति, Kāv.; Pur. (pf. -ममे, Mn.; MBh.; ind.p. -माय, Prab.; inf. -मातुम्, Rājat.);
to mete out, measure, AV.;
to build, make out of (abl.), form, fabricate, produce, create, TS.; Br.; Mn. &c.;
 (with चित्रम्) to paint, Śak.; Daś.;
 (with कोशम्) to compose or write, Cat.;
 (with गिरम्) to utter, Kull.;
 (with नीतिम्) to show, betray, MBh. :
Pass. -मीयते (pf. -ममे, Rājat. v, 425; aor. -अमायि, Cat.),
to be measured out &c.:
Caus. -मापयति, to cause to be made or built, Rājat.; Kathās. :
Desid. -मित्सति, to wish to make or build, Naiṣ.

निर्-√ मुच् P. -मुञ्चति, to loosen, free from (abl.), liberate, RV. &c. &c.:
Pass. -मुच्यते (aor. -अमोचि, ŚBr.), to be freed or free one's self from, get rid of (abl.), RV.; ŚBr.; MBh. &c.;
to be deprived of (instr.), Rājat.;
to be abandoned or given up (as life &c.), ib.;
 (sc. त्वचस्) to cast off (said of a serpent casting its skin), Mṛcch. iii, 9 :
Caus. -मोचयति, to loosen or liberate from (abl.), Hariv.;
to redeem (a pawn) from (abl.), Viṣṇ.

2. निर्-√ यत् Caus. -यातयति, to snatch away, carry off, take or fetch out of (abl.), get, procure, MBh.; Hariv.; Kāv.;
to give back, restore, make restitution, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to give as a present, Lalit.; Divyāv.;
 (वैरम्) to return or show enmity, take revenge, MBh.; R.; Divyāv.;
to forgive, pardon, set free, MW.

निर्-√ या P. -याति, to go out, come forth, go from (abl.) to or into (acc.), set out for (dat., [e.g. युद्धाय, MBh.; दिग्-जयाय, Rājat.] or अर्थम् [e.g. भिक्षार्थम्, Pañc.]), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 (with मृगयाम्) to go hunting, MBh.;
to depart from life, die, Car.;
to pass away (as time), Kāv.;
to weed (a field), MBh. :
Caus. -यापयति, to cause to go out &c., MBh.; R.;
to drive away, expel from (abl.), BhP.

निर्-√ वद् P. Ā. -वदति, ˚ते (aor. -अवादिषम्, -वादिष्टम्), to order off, warn off, expel or drive away, VS.;
to speak out, utter, AV.;
to abuse, revile, MBh.;
to deny, MW.

निर्-√ वप् P. Ā. -वपति, ˚ते (pf. -ववाप, R., -उवाप, Bhaṭṭ., -ऊपे, RV.; fut. -वप्स्यति, TBr., -वपिष्यति, Hariv.; R.),
to pour out, sprinkle, scatter, to offer, present (esp. sacrificial food, the funeral oblation or libation to deceased relatives);
to choose or select for (dat. or gen.),
to distribute (e.g. grain for sacrif. purposes);
to perform (a sacrifice or a funeral oblation &c.), RV. &c. &c.;
 (with कृषिम्) to practise or exercise agriculture, MBh. :
Caus. -वापयति, to sow out, Pañc.;
to choose or select (for the gods), MBh.

निर्-√ 5. वस् P. -वसति, to dwell, finish dwelling (with वासम् &c.), MBh.;
to dwell abroad, MW. :
Caus. -वासयति, to expel from (abl.), banish, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to dismiss, BhP.

निर्-√ वह् P. -वहति (fut. -वोढा, ŚBr.), to lead out of, save from (abl.), RV.; AV.;
to carry off, remove, AV.; ŚBr.; Lāṭy.;
to flow out of (abl.), MānGṛ.;
to bring about, accomplish, Suśr.;
to be brought about, succeed;
to attain one's object, be successful, overcome obstacles, Kathās.; Sarvad. &c.;
to subsist, live on or by (instr.), Campak.;
to be fit or meet, HPariś. :
Caus. -वाहयति, to perform, accomplish, Kathās.; Hit.;
to pass, spend (time), Pañc.

निर्-√ वा P. -वाति (pf. -ववौ), to blow (as wind), R.;
to cease to blow, to be blown out or extinguished;
to be allayed or refreshed or exhilarated, MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -वापयति, to put out, extinguish, allay, cool, refresh, delight, RV.; &c.

निर्-√ विश् P. -विशति (inf. -वेष्टुम्), to enter into (acc. or loc.);
 (esp.) to settle in a home, become a householder (also with गृहेषु);
to marry, Kāv.; Pur.;
to pay, render, offer (भर्तृपिण्डम्), MBh.;
to enjoy, delight in (acc.), Hariv.; Kāv. &c.;
to go out or forth, W.;
to embellish, MW.;
to reward, ib.

निर्-√ वृत् Ā. -वर्तते (P. only in fut. -वर्त्स्यामि, to cause to roll out or cast (as dice), MBh. iv, 24 [B.]; fut. -वर्त्स्यति and cond. -अवर्त्स्यत्, to take place, happen, Bhaṭṭ.),
to come forth, originate, develop, become, ŚBr.; Up. &c.;
to be accomplished or effected or finished, come off;
 take place (cf. above), Mn.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 often w.r. for नि-वृत्, q.v.:
Caus. -वर्तयति (ind.p. -वर्त्य; Pass. -वर्त्यते),
to cause to come forth, bring out, turn out, do away with, remove, Hariv.; Rājat.;
to bring about, complete, finish, perform, make, produce, create, RV. &c. &c.;
to gladden, satisfy (अ-निर्वर्त्य v.l. for अ-निर्वृत्य), BhP.

निर्-√ हन् P. -हन्ति, to strike off, expel, remove, strike or knock out (eye, tooth &c.), hew down, kill, destroy, RV. &c. &c.:
Caus. -घातयति, to take out, remove, Suśr.;
to kill, destroy, MBh.

निर्-√ हृ P. Ā. -हरति, ˚ते, to take out or off, draw or pull out, extract from (abl.), expel, remove, destroy, RV. &c. &c.;
to export (goods), Mn.;
to carry out (a dead body), ib.; Yājñ.;
to let (blood), Suśr.;
to purge, ib.;
 (Ā.) to exclude or deliver from (abl.), TS.; ŚBr.;
to shake off, get rid of (acc.), Āpast.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to change or interchange (clothes), Mn. viii, 396;
to fix, Śulbas.;
to get, receive, SaddhP. :
Caus. -हारयति, to cause (a dead body) to be carried out, Kull. on Mn. v, 104 :
Desid. -जिहीर्षति, to wish to take off or subtract, Śulbas. (cf. निर्-जिहीर्षु).
